  "bodyHash": "a92e7f91b54596d3",
  "content": "\n\n<h3>FTB Ultimine <em>(适用于 Fabric)</em></h3>\n<p>FTB Ultimine 提供了高效的模式，可同时采集多个方块。只需在 Minecraft 控制设置中按住配置的指定按键即可激活模组，收集到的物品会直接掉落在你的脚下，因此你无需四处走动！在 1.15 及更高版本中，该模组通过在即将挖掘的方块周围渲染白色线条来增强可见性，这不仅清晰地指示了你的挖掘范围，外观也更加酷炫！</p>\n<p>如需了解更多关于 FTB Ultimine 的信息，请访问我们的文档站点：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-ultimine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-ultimine</a></p>\n<h4><strong>支持并需要</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com//assets/a1/mods/supports-fabric@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><strong>搭配使用</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><strong>主要功能</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高效采集方块</strong>：按住可配置的 `~` / `` ` `` 键，即可同时采集多个方块，大幅简化挖矿流程。</li>\n<li><strong>增强的视觉效果 (1.15+)</strong>：通过白色线条高亮显示即将挖掘、采集或耕作的方块，让你清晰掌握操作范围，告别误操作！</li>\n<li><strong>锄头耕种草地</strong>：将功能扩展至农业，使用锄头点击草地即可像耕作一样同时处理多个方块，省时省力。</li>\n<li><strong>作物收割</strong>：右键点击作物即可简化收割过程，轻松高效地收集资源。</li>\n<li><strong>草方块特殊处理</strong>：利用独特的机制处理草方块，有效管理超出标准 1 格范围的类草方块。</li>\n<li><strong>挖掘辅助</strong>：借助此模组，你可以轻松挖掘隧道，无论是向上或向下的楼梯，还是通往下一个矿洞的路径，都不在话下！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FTB Ultimine 旨在优化您的挖矿与农耕活动，提供流畅高效的游戏体验。它已收录于我们众多的整合包及其他第三方整合包中！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OCYVCUi.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OY1v6uo.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您也可以使用锄头点击草地，以类似方式同时耕作多个方块：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/rB22fHN.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>并通过右键点击来收割作物：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/vMBREKF.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>草方块拥有特殊处理机制，可检测距离超过 1 格的方块：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/w3Pad8m.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>技术支持</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如遇<strong>整合包</strong>相关问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>如遇<strong>模组</strong>相关问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有任何问题？欢迎加入我们的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持关注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
